notes.content:
Hello everybody, how are you doing?

Yesterday, I uploaded a new build with some additions and modifications, as follow:

What was added

 9 Acheivements: you can get them on Progressive Mode
 Simplified Chinese translation;

What was changed

 Gameplay background was changed to fit a more minimalistic and relaxing feeling;
 Some palettes were reviewed based on feedbacks from you. Now they are sorted in a better gradient, easier to memorize;
 Gameplay UI was moved to the top and those right and left sensors were removed;
 Hints were removed for a while: since I've changed for the new save system, it stopped to work;
 Some levels' name were changed to more concise names;
 Level 46 (Danger zone) were removed, since it was not fitting the game theme at all. I will replace with another one;

Roadmap

Here are the next steps of Sudokolorful:

 Fix hint feature;
 Replace Level 46 with a new one;
 Add a button for notes on UI, since most people are used to it instead of clicking the middle mouse button or CTRL+ click. I will keep there three ways of adding notes;
 Add Window mode;
 Add 2 more palettes;
 Add a very hard difficulty in Classic Mode;
